From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:55:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: SVG value objects and members, plugin host sites,
 window/document leftovers

SVGLength, SVGAnimatedLength, SVGAnimatedEnumeration, SVGNumber, SVGAngle, SVGRect, SVGMatrix, SVGPoint and SVGTransform objects, the SVGElement/SVGSVGElement/circle/text-content members (lengths bound to the attributes, matrices, text metrics from layout rectangles); plugin host property bags, frame and UI window, in-place and control site members, ambient properties, IBindHost bind methods; window opener, offscreenBuffering, print, maxConnectionsPerServer, private-window FindWindowByName/GetPendingUrl; DOMImplementation createDocumentType/createDocument; document media, parentDocument, updateSettings and class info. Initialise dti in preprocess_dispex_data.

